{title:Somos El Barco}
{subtitle:By Lorre Wyatt, performed by Peter, Paul, and Mary}
{key:F}

*Intro: 
[F] We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
I sail in [Bb] you, [C] you sail in [F] me

*Chorus: 
[F] Somos el [Bb] barco, [C] somos el [F] mar, 
Yo navego en [Bb] ti, [C] tu navegas en [F] mi [F7]
We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
I sail in [Bb] you, [C] you sail in [F] me [F7]

Verse 1:
The [Bb] stream sings it [C] to the river, 
the [F] river sings it to the [Dm] sea 
The [Gm] sea sings it [C] to the boat that 
[F] carries you and [F7] me 

*Chorus: 
[F] Somos el [Bb] barco, [C] somos el [F] mar, 
Yo navego en [Bb] ti, [C] tu navegas en [F] mi [F7]
We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
I sail in [Bb] you, [C] you sail in [F] me [F7]
 
*Verse 2: 
The [Bb] boat we are [C] sailing in was 
[F] built by many [Dm] hands 
The [Gm] sea we are [C] sailing on, 
it [F] touches many [F7] lands 

*Chorus: 
[F] Somos el [Bb] barco, [C] somos el [F] mar, 
Yo navego en [Bb] ti, [C] tu navegas en [F] mi [F7]
We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
I sail in [Bb] you, [C] you sail in [F] me [F7] 

*&blue:Break: 
&blue:[F] Somos el [Bb] barco, [C] somos el [F] mar, 
&blue:Yo navego en [Bb] ti, [C] tu navegas en [F] mi [F7]
&blue:	We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
&blue:I sail in [Bb] you, [C] you sail in [F] me

*Verse 3: 
So [Bb] with our hopes we [C] set the sails 
And [F] face the winds once [Dm] more 
And [Gm] with our hearts we [C] chart the waters 
[F] never sailed be [F7] fore 

*Chorus: 
[F] Somos el [Bb] barco, [C] somos el [F] mar, 
Yo navego en [Bb] ti, [C] tu navegas en [F] mi [F7]
We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
I sail in [Bb] you, [C] you sail in [F] me [F7]

*Verse 4: 
El [Bb] arroyo le canta al [C] rio; 
El [F] rio le canta al [Dm] mar 
Y el [Gm] mar le canta al [C] barco, que 
[F] lejos nos va a lle [F7] var 

*Chorus: 
[F] Somos el [Bb] barco, [C] somos el [F] mar, 
Yo navego en [Bb] ti, [C] tu navegas en [F] mi [F7]
We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
I sail in [Bb] you, [C] you sail in [F] me [F7]

*Ending: 
We are the [Bb] boat, [C] we are the [F] sea, [Dm]
 I sail in [Bb] you, 
[C] (hold ////-/) you sail in [F] me  
